<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila stops Nasipit rise at 105 pesos.</title>
<headline>Manila stops Nasipit rise at 105 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange said on Monday it has put a cap on the price of Nasipit Lumber Co Inc shares at 105 pesos after it soared by 50 percent in early trade.</p>
</text>
